course: dictionary
lesson: 10887
title: Violent: strong force and sudden power
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Violent means using strong physical force to hurt or damage people or things. «Violent behaviour», such as hitting or kicking, is never okay, and you should tell a trusted adult if someone is violent.
explain: The word can also describe nature. A «violent storm» is very strong and sudden, with wind and rain that can cause damage. Read the words around violent to decide which meaning fits.
explain: Violent can describe very strong feelings too, like a violent temper or a violent cough. Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. A violent cough is not someone hitting you. It is a cough that is very strong and sudden.
fact: Violent means using strong physical force to hurt or damage people or things.
fact: «Violent» can describe a very strong and sudden storm, earthquake or volcano.
fact: «Violent» can also describe very strong feelings, such as a violent temper or a violent cough.
fact: «Become violent» means someone starts to hurt others with force.
fact: Films and games may be rated as too violent for children, so check the rating before you watch or play.
exercise: «When a younger sibling wants to watch a violent game, switch to a game suitable for them.» What does violent mean here? | *Full of strong, harmful force or fighting | Slow and gentle | Very funny and silly | Very quiet and calm
exercise: «Genesis tells of Noah, a good man in a violent world.» What does violent suggest about the world? | *A world full of harmful force and danger | A world with lots of sweets | A world with no weather | A world that is very quiet
exercise: A violent storm means a storm that is | very far away | *very strong and sudden | very small and slow | very pretty
test: Your friend says a violent cough means someone is hitting. What is the best answer? | A cough that is quiet | *A cough that is very strong and sudden | A friend who is hitting | A cough in a game
test: What should you do if someone becomes violent towards you? | *Tell a trusted adult | Ignore it and do nothing | Wait and hope it stops by itself | Keep it secret forever
exam: «Many gaming YouTubers make videos for grown-ups, with strong swearing and violent games.» In this sentence, violent means | short and funny | easy to play | *involving strong force and fighting in the game | soft and calm
